WEBVTT

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:12.110
Say, have you picked a club?

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:14.110
You seem pretty athletic!

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:16.470
Want to try tennis?

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:17.980
No thank you, I'm...

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.880
Sorry to make you wait!

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.130
It's okay.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.330
Incredible, Aoi-chan, everyone's trying to recruit you.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:34.510
Well, it is club enrollment season after all.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.630
Ami, are you thinking of joining any?

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:44.940
I made it into college,
so I'd like to try something, but...

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.070
Ami, are you okay?!

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:50.640
Owww.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:51.930
I'm okay.

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.660
Here, can you stand?

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.440
Thanks, Aoi-chan.

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:05.860
Aoi-chan is always so cool...

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:05.860
We still have time until the bus gets here.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:07.450
Anywhere you want to drop by?

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:24.390
What's wrong, Ami?

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:26.470
That girl...

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.340
You know her?

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:34.470
Is there something about that folding bike?

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:40.160
Ami?

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:42.400
So cute...

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:21.090
I never expected you to take an interest in cycling.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:24.330
I can't ride a bike like yours.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:29.350
But maybe I could manage that folding bike we just saw...

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:34.840
Ami riding a bike, huh?
I'm getting anxious just thinking of you falling.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.600
You tripped just now too.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.670
But... But you know...!

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:44.120
I've sort of been curious about cycling for a while now.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.620
Really?

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:46.610
Uh-huh!

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:50.330
Whenever I saw you riding your bicycle...

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:55.750
I always thought it looked like fun
or that it must feel good.

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:59.010
Why didn't you tell me?

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:04.940
Oh, I was afraid of falling, like you said.

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:07.390
So I couldn't make up my mind.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:13.270
But I think I can give it a go on a cute bicycle like that!

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:15.340
But you're scared of falling, right?

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:18.100
Well, yeah.

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.640
But...

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:24.560
I think I could manage with that bicycle.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:32.650
Then, do you want to take a look right now?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.670
I know a shop that might carry one.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.170
I want to go! Take me there!

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:42.300
All right.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:46.670
Thank you, Aoi-chan!

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:58.360
I'm sure they sell them here.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.510
There it is!

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:16.700
Yes! It's small and cute, and so cool!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.910
They have all kinds.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.470
Aoi-chan?

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.670
What's the matter?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:35.520
W-Well... there's a ridiculous number
on the price tag, but...

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.630
that last digit's just a mistake, right?

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:43.740
I get what you're trying to say,
but for models like these...

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:47.130
The prices aren't wrong.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:50.180
That one's over 600,000 yen.

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.410
Six?

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.480
The one over there is close to a million.

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:59.710
A-Are you kidding me?

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.070
A bicycle shouldn't cost that much...

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:06.630
I withdrew all my money.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:11.890
My entire savings of 62,052 yen.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:15.630
It doesn't even make a dent!

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:26.280
Who knew bicycles were so expensive?!

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.480
S-Sorry, Aoi-chan.

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:34.770
Ami...

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:38.810
There are other stores.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:40.290
Want to take a look?

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:46.550
I think this shop isn't as expensive.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:50.000
But as for the performance...

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.800
Huh? Ami?

00:06:55.380 --> 00:07:00.190
This bike is small and stout...

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.800
To think there was such a cute...

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:08.810
But it's probably expensive and out of my reach...

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:14.650
It's cheap!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:20.040
No, it's not cheap...
but cheaper than the others!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.790
What's the difference from the last one?

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.740
Well, there's performance and some other factors...

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:27.660
I see...

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:32.000
But it's cute!

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:35.660
Yeah... I admit, it's cute, but...

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.890
I think you should take a look at some of the other...

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.420
Nope, I've decided!

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.090
I want this one!

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:48.690
That was a quick decision.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:52.410
I just couldn't resist.

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:55.660
Like love at first sight.

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:56.860
I see.

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:00.480
By the way, Ami...

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:06.290
You said you wanted to start cycling,
but what are you planning to do specifically?

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:11.200
Are you going to ride it to school?

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:17.300
Actually, I haven't given it much thought.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.520
I just...

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:23.060
was never good at anything.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:27.820
So I think I want this to be a long-term commitment.

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:32.320
Riding on this bike and moving my body seems like fun.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:38.080
If I can continue, I think it'll give me confidence.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:43.580
Then I might... be able to change a little!

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:45.080
...or something.

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:48.840
Is that so?

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:52.910
Then how about we go cycling during our next break?

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:58.010
That way you'll have a reason to ride next time.

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:03.050
I'm starting to get nervous...

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:06.510
Cycling with him... That...

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:08.770
That...

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:12.930
Ah... um, you don't have to force
yourself if you don't want to.

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:16.300
That sounds like so much fun!

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:19.290
I'm going! I'm definitely going!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:22.710
Definitely! Definitely! De-fi-nitely!

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:25.630
It's a promise, okay, Aoi-chan?!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.460
Okay.

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:35.540
What kind of wonderful things
are in store for you and me?

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:47.300
I'm so excited!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.930
You're sooo cute!

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:57.570
We'll always be together from now on!

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:00.400
I'm counting on you!

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:04.490
Onee-chan, what are you doing?

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.960
Huh?!

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:20.620
It's a perfect day for cycling!

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:33.390
But I've gotta say...

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:37.460
Ponta-kun!

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:40.160
You are so cute!

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:43.360
The sun is really making you sparkle!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.620
I can't stay still!

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:51.030
What're you doing, Ami?

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:59.880
Oh... I just got carried away...

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.040
Oh yeah?

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:06.090
Uh-huh. I was so excited last night, I didn't...

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:11.760
Oh, but your bike is as cool cool as ever.

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:13.150
Think so?

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:17.850
But... my Ponta-kun's winning when it comes to cuteness!

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.390
Ponta-kun?

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:23.730
That's his name.

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:26.730
Look!

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:30.370
Pontac?

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:34.670
Yup, Pontac... that's why I call him Ponta-kun.

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.050
So that's it...

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:46.560
Small, cute, and stout!
Isn't it the perfect name for this bike?

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:49.670
Yeah, sure...

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:53.800
But you have to calm down,
it can be dangerous.

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:57.690
So anyway...

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:01.320
Where are we going today?

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:03.230
Ah,

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:06.580
I'm thinking we should ride down this cycling road.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:10.080
There's almost no danger of cars on this road,

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:13.920
and it's a flat, easy path,
about 40 kilometers round trip.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:17.590
It's just right for
a beginner like you, Ami.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:21.590
If you get tired,
we don't have to go all the way.

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.290
We can take it easy.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:28.340
Okay, shall we go, Ponta-kun?

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:40.100
Here we go!

00:12:56.110 --> 00:13:00.380
This is amazing.
The scenery is changing around me so quickly...

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:03.460
I'm seeing the world from higher up than usual,

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:06.890
so everything I'm used to looks brand new to me!

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:25.180
The breeze feels so good.

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:29.190
It feels like we've come so far.

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.040
Hey!

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:40.290
Don't get carried away and go too fast. You'll get tired.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.800
It's okay! I'm fine!

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:46.290
I feel like I could go on forever!

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:54.330
I can feel how my own strength is pushing me forward.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:59.220
Now that I know how it feels, I can't stop!

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:11.410
Huh? What's this...?

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:14.160
My body feels...

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:19.740
Hey...

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.430
Are you okay, Ami?

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.930
Thanks, Aoi-chan.

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:39.020
I wonder what's wrong?

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.260
My hands and legs are shaking.

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:44.570
You got carried away and overworked yourself.

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:53.080
It was like... I suddenly had no strength left...

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:55.690
It felt so weird.

00:14:57.570 --> 00:15:01.280
I felt like I could go anywhere if I had this bike with me.

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:04.740
But maybe it's impossible for me.

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:10.120
You suddenly didn't have any strength, huh?

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:14.670
Ami, did you eat a proper breakfast?

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:19.350
I didn't... eat.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.180
I figured I'd feel nauseous if I ate before exercising.

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:23.510
That's it!

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:27.530
You have to eat properly!
No wonder you collapsed.

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:29.900
Ami.

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:34.940
Before any exercise, you need
good rest and nutrition. That's basic.

00:15:37.650 --> 00:15:42.450
You didn't get enough sleep
and didn't eat breakfast before exercising,

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:45.790
so you're feeling something called "Hunger Knock."

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:48.270
Hunger knock?

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.800
Simply put, you ran out of energy.

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:52.690
Is that it?

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:55.330
You need to replenish your energy to go on.

00:15:56.420 --> 00:16:00.420
Still, I didn't expect to need
replenishments at this distance.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.760
Excuse me!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:10.190
What's up?

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:13.270
My friend got hunger knock and...

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:16.940
What? Is she a beginner?

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:21.830
Yes, today's my first time cycling.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.070
Well, I guess it can't be helped...

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:25.860
Here.

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:27.590
What's this?

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.210
An energy supplement.

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:33.270
Eat this and rest a bit,
then you'll be able to pedal.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:34.590
That's...

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:36.670
Thank you!

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.380
Too sweet!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.450
What is this?!

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:51.740
It doesn't taste great,
but it works fast.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:53.490
Eat is all up.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:02.430
How is it?

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:06.750
It sort of leaves an aftertaste.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.410
I meant physically.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:18.640
Wow, amazing! My strength is back!

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.500
Thank you very much.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.390
Th-Thank you very much!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:29.400
But I think you should get
a little more nourishment, right?

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:33.430
In that case, there's a good place for that nearby.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.880
Wow! This is so good!

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:43.790
I feel revitalized!

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:47.080
Is this a dairy farm?

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.790
I didn't know there was a place like this around here.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:55.800
It's the smallest dairy farm in Japan.
Some people probably never notice it.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.660
That's true.

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.050
Anyway...

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:03.880
Cycling without eating?
No wonder you hit the wall.

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:06.760
You're absolutely right.

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:11.470
Be careful from now on.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:15.570
Yes! I'm so sorry.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:19.580
Though you were fortunate it happened near this place.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:25.080
When you're exhausted from cycling,
nothing beats their gelato!

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:29.820
Absolutely, this is really delicious.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:34.090
I could eat this every day!

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.650
Want to come every day, then?

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:38.460
Huh? Can we?

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:43.740
You'd need to cycle all the way here every day though.

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:46.220
Oh... That's right.

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:50.730
For a start, you have to be careful not to run out of steam along the way.

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:55.980
Can we put this on hold for the time being?

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.190
See you!

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:08.980
Thank you for everything.

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:11.070
Thank you very much!

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:15.600
Oh!

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:16.630
What's the matter?

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:21.520
I forgot to ask their names.
They took such good care of me.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:23.040
That's right!

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.090
I wonder if we'll see them again.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:31.550
We met while cycling.
I'm sure we'll see them again.

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:33.270
Yeah!

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:36.810
Say, Aoi-chan...

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:41.520
I realized after cycling today...

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.730
Riding a bike isn't that easy, is it?

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:49.330
I caused you, and those two, so much trouble.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:51.900
Wait, I don't mind at all, but...

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:54.780
I have to get better.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:59.460
But... But you know...

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:06.350
I had so much fun riding my bike with you today, Aoi-chan!

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.020
Thank you, Aoi-chan!

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:14.720
Ami...

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:19.890
Let's go cycling again, okay?

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:24.920
Sure. But be careful not to get
hunger knock next time, okay?

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:29.540
Okay! I'll get lots of rest
and eat properly next time around.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.860
Okay, shall we head home?

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:42.620
That's right! We have to go back on this same path!

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:47.390
I'm so tired, Aoi-chan!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:50.590
Take it slow and hang in there.

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:04.770
You really strained your muscles.

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.930
I can barely move.

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:17.490
I can't go on...

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:19.670
I can't move.

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:22.300
Hey, are you okay?

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:25.790
If you can't move because you're hungry, want this?

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:33.080
That's... from yesterday...!

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:35.940
Huh?

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:39.190
Huh?

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:51.820
And so,

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:54.820
with a little miracle like this...

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:58.990
my cycling life began!

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.600
My first experience with cycling was so much fun!

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:36.470
The scenery I passed, the gelato at the finish line...

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:37.770
It was the best!

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:39.980
I can't wait to go again!

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:44.470
Next time on Long Riders:
"Cycling Along the Coastline!"
